# VAN — gates (shared common contract)

**Карта (brownfield):** `memory-bank/architecture/`
**Brownfield:** @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-van-brownfield.mdc
**Пути:** @.cursor/rules/shared/memory-bank-paths.mdc

## Gates (common)

1. `memory-bank/` valid по paths — иначе create; abort до valid
2. Обязательны: `tasks.md`, `activeContext.md`, `projectbrief.md`
3. Mode detected: greenfield | brownfield
4. Complexity / level определён и зафиксирован
5. Контекст ясен из tasks + activeContext
6. **Brownfield:** architecture shards refreshed + `architecture/index.md` updated; session van log с links; mermaid minimum (services + data-flow + erd|n/a)

## Complexity

| L | Сложность | sNN |
|---|-----------|-----|
| L1 | лёгкая | 1 |
| L2 | средняя | 2 |
| L3 | сложная | 3 |

## Abort

- Invalid memory bank → fix first
- Complexity / level не определён → не рекомендовать next / IMPLEMENT / PLAN
- Brownfield без architecture refresh / TOC-only architecture → FAIL
